App Store Description:
Explore Sun Siyam Vilu Reef and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Vilu Reef Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended Must do list of experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal concierge in your pocket!

About the Resort:
Stay at the water villas of Sun Siyam Vilu Reef Maldives and enjoy 5 star luxury with the sand beneath your feet. The ultimate haven for honeymooners, sink into new levels of relaxation with the waves as your soundtrack. You’ll soon see why we welcome back so many familiar faces year after year.
Slow down the pace and enjoy decadent treatments in our spa or choose to unwind in the comfort of your own suite or villa. Come evening, join our chefs as they dish up plates with artistry and flair, before ending your perfect day with a private cinema under the stars.

Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant experiences, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or to request to book spa treatments;
- View the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- Request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- View your bills that you are incurred while at the resort;
- Book your next stay at the resort.
